subproblems.statement:
Let P ∈ ℕ and ι a finite type. For each k ∈ ι let p_k, v_k ∈ ℝ^P with ‖v_k‖ = 1, I_k ⊆ ℝ open and c_k ∈ ℤ. Put γ_k(t) := p_k + t·v_k and S_k := γ_k(I_k), and assume H¹(S_j ∩ closure(S_k)) = 0 for all j ≠ k, where H¹ = μHE[1]. Then there is a 1-dimensional integer multiplicity triple R = (M, θ, ξ) in ℝ^P (IMRep univ 1) with:
- carrier M = ⋃_{k : c_k ≠ 0} S_k;
- multiplicity θ(x) = Σ_k 1_{S_k}(x)·|c_k| (natAbs) for every x;
- θ(x)·ξ(x)(α) = Σ_k 1_{S_k}(x)·c_k·α(fun _ => v_k) for every x ∈ ℝ^P and every 1-covector α.

Let P ∈ ℕ and ι a finite type. For each k ∈ ι let p_k, v_k ∈ ℝ^P with ‖v_k‖ = 1, I_k ⊆ ℝ measurable and c_k ∈ ℤ; put γ_k(t) := p_k + t·v_k and S_k := γ_k(I_k). Let R be any 1-dimensional integer multiplicity triple in ℝ^P (IMRep univ 1) such that:
- R.carrier = ⋃_{k : c_k ≠ 0} S_k;
- R.mult(x) = Σ_k 1_{S_k}(x)·|c_k| (natAbs) for all x;
- R.mult(x)·R.orient(x)(α) = Σ_k 1_{S_k}(x)·c_k·α(fun _ => v_k) for all x and all 1-covectors α.
Then:
(i) R.action(ω) = Σ_k c_k·∫_{I_k} ω(γ_k(t))(fun _ => v_k) dt for every ω ∈ 𝒟¹(ℝ^P);
(ii) R.measure(A) = Σ_k |c_k|·ℒ¹(I_k ∩ γ_k⁻¹(A)) for every measurable A ⊆ ℝ^P, with |c_k| entering as ENNReal.ofReal |(c_k : ℝ)|.
